WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.102
-Guys, as you know, every week,
we like to bring you

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.804
some uplifting, creative videos,
whether they come from

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.206
quarantine or just stuff
around the country.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:09.242
It's time for "What Are You
Doing Wednesday."

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:11.777
-♪ What do you do
when it's Wednesday? ♪

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:15.148
♪ What do you do when
it's Wednesday? ♪

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:17.650
-First up, this toddler
really wanted to

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.552
close his refrigerator door.

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:29.261
-[ Laughing ] Stop. No. No.

00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:30.663
-[ Laughing ] Oh, my God.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:32.098
-Hold up.
Can I get out the fridge?

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:36.502
-[ Crying ]

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:38.938
-My bad. No problem.
-Yeah.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:42.475
That's settled. There you go.

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:45.211
Next, this husband
couldn't find his wife,

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.446
so he went out
and checked in the driveway.

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:48.481
Look at this.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:51.017
-And I want y'all to see
what I just saw.

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:52.685
I'm in here cooking dinner,

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:56.789
watching the kids,
cleaning up dishes.

00:00:56.789 --> 00:01:01.494
And I came out here
to throw some trash away,

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:04.564
and what I found
was Allison out here

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:07.633
eating a Push Pop while I'm in
there making dinner for her.

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:09.835
And now she's trying to hide
from it, but I caught her.

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:11.571
-Who are you talking to?
-I caught her.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.206
She's out here. Look at her.

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:14.841
I said, "Hey, go get us
some drinks

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:17.242
while I'm out here cleaning up
the dishes and making dinner

00:01:17.242 --> 00:01:18.277
and watching the kids.

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:19.812
Just run to
the store real quick."

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:22.015
And I come out here and
catch her eating a Push Pop.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.620
-Busted. And, finally,
this person managed to catch

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.089
the beginning of
a beautiful friendship.

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:33.126
[ Luciano Michelini's
"Frolic" playing ]

00:01:38.797 --> 00:01:39.899
-There you go, everybody.

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.267
That is "What Are
You Doing Wednesday."

